    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "3. It has been submitted by learned counsel for the applicant that furnishing of two sureties in all 28 different cases is almost impracticable as the applicant is facing hardship and he will not be able to arrange 56 sureties to get bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4337,
      "end": 4577,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15148401260375977
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "4. It is further submitted by learned counsel for the applicant that in similar circumstances, namely,\nin the case of Hani Nishad @ Mohammad Imran @ Vikky Vs. The State of Uttar Pradesh [SLP (Crl.)\nNo.8914-8915/2018) the Hon'ble Apex Court vide order dated 29.10.2018 has permitted the petitioner/applicant to submit personal bonds and two sureties of heavy amount to hold good in all the cases.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4579,
      "end": 4974,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Hani Nishad @ Mohammad Imran @ Vikky Vs. The State of Uttar Pradesh [SLP (Crl.)\nNo.8914-8915/2018)",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 4697,
          "end": 4795
        },
        {
          "text": "Apex Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 4808,
          "end": 4818
        },
        {
          "text": "29.10.2018",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4836,
          "end": 4846
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3315867781639099
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "5. Considering the aforesaid fact, the application (u/s 482 Cr.P.C.) is disposed of and it is directed that the applicant shall furnish a personal bond and two sureties in one case which shall be treated to be valid in all other cases wherein the bail order has been passed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 4976,
      "end": 5250,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "s 482",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 5030,
          "end": 5035
